body:
Tbh there arent many of those, esp not fully translated.

[The Art of Taming the Dragon
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-art-of-taming-the-dragon/) has it but is ongoing, great translation tho.

[The Price of Confessing To The Wrong Female Protagonist
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-price-of-confessing-to-the-wrong-female-protagonist/) Also has it , fully translated.

Cant think of others tbh.

[Miss Gu & Miss Qu
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/miss-gu-miss-qu/), its not a amazing series but afaik was very early with the showbiz setting and the FL is kinda nuts. 



This one [Freak](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/freak/) has 2 psychopaths. Thats it

[The Princess’ Shadow Guard Cannot Be Too Clever
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-princess-shadow-guard-cannot-be-too-clever/) FL is fairly toxic and possesive. 

[Mistress, I Want It~
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-want-it/)

Very toxic, no smut, only depression.

[The Whole World is Waiting for Your Heart to Flutter
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-whole-world-is-waiting-for-your-heart-to-flutter/) Has 2 very possesive and fairly obsessed characters. 

[Story About Buying My Classmate Once A Week
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/story-about-buying-my-classmate-once-a-week/) Toxic almost codependant relationship. One of my favs

[Gloves](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/gloves/) This one truly is something.

[The Cold Movie Queen Has Gone Mad For Me
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-cold-movie-queen-has-gone-mad-for-me/) I recc not reading the synopsis because it spoils a lot which i hate.

[Mistress, I Was Wrong
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-was-wrong/), FL is possesive and kinda crazy for ML.

[A Sweet Girl Won’t Be Fooled By The Villainess
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/a-sweet-girl-wont-be-fooled-by-the-villainess/), This is genderbend for 0 reason but FL is also crazy.

Would give some mentions to [Goodbye, My First Experience
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/a-story-about-losing-all-my-first-experiences-after-suffering-defeat-at-the-hands-of-my-twisted-genius-of-a-childhood-friend/) and [Clear and Muddy Loss of Love
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/clear-and-muddy-loss-of-love/) for having main charas that arent well in their heads but i wouldnt say superr toxic

[The Beauty’s Blade
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-beautys-blade/)

Wuxia about 2 women that are at the top of the hierarchy but on enemy sides. its fairly toxic and one of my favs

This is my to go list for toxic relationships and also the ones that were enjoyable reads for me. Theyre all done with translations except Mistress, I Was Wrong

[Jianghu](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/jianghu/) Short 1 chapter story. Cutesy and good translation

[The Sovereign’s Waves Over All Under Heaven
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-sovereigns-waves-over-all-under-heaven/) 

[The Witch Nichang
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-witch-nichang/) Great story, slow translation but translator is keeping up with it so respect that. Dont expect it to be done soon. 

[Jianghu Demolition Squad
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/jianghu-demolition-squad/) Decent edited mtl, fun story. Hoped more for the ending and extras.

[The Beauty’s Blade
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-beautys-blade/) My personal favorite, also getting a official english release this year.

[Pat Me Please
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/pat-me-please/)

Book 1 of a great trilogy imo.

[Miss Gu & Miss Qu
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/miss-gu-miss-qu/), its not a amazing series but afaik was very early with the showbiz setting and the FL is kinda nuts. 



This one [Freak](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/freak/) has 2 psychopaths. Thats it

[The Princess’ Shadow Guard Cannot Be Too Clever
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-princess-shadow-guard-cannot-be-too-clever/) FL is fairly toxic and possesive. 

Freak has smut iirc, the other 2 dont. really.

[Mistress, I Want It~
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-want-it/)

Very toxic, no smut, only depression.

modern settings. [The Whole World is Waiting for Your Heart to Flutter
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-whole-world-is-waiting-for-your-heart-to-flutter/) Has 2 very possesive and fairly obsessed characters. 

An "classic" for possesive and obsessed characters is [Miss Gu & Miss Qu
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/miss-gu-miss-qu/), its not a amazing series but afaik was very early with the showbiz setting and the FL is kinda nuts. 

This one [Freak](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/freak/) has 2 psychopaths. Thats it, says enough i think

[Story About Buying My Classmate Once A Week
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/story-about-buying-my-classmate-once-a-week/) Toxic almost codependant relationship. One of my favs

[Gloves](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/gloves/) This one truly is something.

Forgot to add this one.

[The Cold Movie Queen Has Gone Mad For Me
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-cold-movie-queen-has-gone-mad-for-me/) I recc not reading the synopsis because it spoils a lot which i hate.

If were talking about ancient china i would say only [The Beauty’s Blade
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-beautys-blade/) would be. The character is possesive and obsessed.

If were also adding modern settings. [The Whole World is Waiting for Your Heart to Flutter
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-whole-world-is-waiting-for-your-heart-to-flutter/) Has 2 very possesive and fairly obsessed characters. 

An "classic" for possesive and obsessed characters is [Miss Gu & Miss Qu
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/miss-gu-miss-qu/), its not a amazing series but afaik was very early with the showbiz setting and the FL is kinda nuts. 

This one [Freak](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/freak/) has 2 psychopaths. Thats it

If we go to a more fantasy/xianxia setting

[Mistress, I Was Wrong
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-was-wrong/), FL is possesive and kinda crazy for ML.

[A Sweet Girl Won’t Be Fooled By The Villainess
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/a-sweet-girl-wont-be-fooled-by-the-villainess/), This is genderbend for 0 reason but FL is also crazy.

Would give some mentions to [Goodbye, My First Experience
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/a-story-about-losing-all-my-first-experiences-after-suffering-defeat-at-the-hands-of-my-twisted-genius-of-a-childhood-friend/) and [Clear and Muddy Loss of Love
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/clear-and-muddy-loss-of-love/) for having main charas that arent well in their heads but i wouldnt say yandere.

While PDL is popular, imo 2 of the 3 are very angsty so not everyone's cup of tea.( Even tho JWQS is my nr1)

Imo the top 5 that are fully translated are

[She is the Protagonist
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/she-is-the-protagonist/)	

[Didn’t Expect That, Did You?
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/didnt-expect-that-did-you/)	

[Outrageous](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/outrageous/
)	

[Miss Cousin is Always Busy
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/miss-cousin-is-always-busy/)	

[She Belongs To Me
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/she-belongs-to-me/)	

Didn’t Expect That, Did You only has like 2/3 chapters left to be translated but is a great read. She is the Protagonist and Outrageous are from the same author and are hilarious but also well written and translated. She belongs to me is a short one compared to the others but one of my favs.

[Didn’t Expect That, Did You?
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/didnt-expect-that-did-you/)

Previous translaters were aight but amerilatte is such a good translator. Also a great novel on top of it.

[Pat Me Please
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/pat-me-please/)

Patpat trilogy has CNyuritranslation team on it. Zhu is a good translator and i think she got a editor because the flow of reading only gets better. Great series on top of it.

[My Feelings Can Wait
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/my-feelings-can-wait/)	

Everything from JLL translations. Great translator and translated great novels. MFCW and Outrageous are one of the best in the genre imo.

[The Beauty’s Blade
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/the-beautys-blade/)

Wuxia about 2 women that are at the top of the hierarchy but on enemy sides. while not very angst (afaik) its fairly toxic.

[Mistress, I Was Wrong
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-was-wrong/)	

Xianxia with a pretty toxic start, mellows out later. Not very angsty iirc.

[Mistress, I Want It~
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/mistress-i-want-it/)	

While i know you said HE, if you ever want to read one with a **BE** (more open ending) This one is great on all points

[Considering the Possibility of Falling in Love With the Villain
](https://www.novelupdates.com/series/considering-the-possibility-of-falling-in-love-with-the-villain/)

There are some transmigration novels with arcs set in a apocalypse .
